### 步骤1：修正 `saveSnapshotOnDragEndAtom` 不清除 redo 栈

**问题**：拖拽结束保存快照时未清空 redo 栈，导致连续拖拽后重做行为异常。

**修改文件**：`stores/workflow-store-jotai.ts`

**修改前**（第249-261行）：
```typescript
export const saveSnapshotOnDragEndAtom = atom(
  null,
  (get, set) => {
    const snapshot: Snapshot = { nodes: get(nodesAtom), edges: get(edgesAtom) };
    const stack = get(undoStackAtom);
    if (stack.length >= 50) {
      set(undoStackAtom, [...stack.slice(1), snapshot]);
    } else {
      set(undoStackAtom, [...stack, snapshot]);
    }
    // 不清除 redo
  }
);
```

**修改后**：
```typescript
export const saveSnapshotOnDragEndAtom = atom(
  null,
  (get, set) => {
    const snapshot: Snapshot = { nodes: get(nodesAtom), edges: get(edgesAtom) };
    const stack = get(undoStackAtom);
    if (stack.length >= 50) {
      set(undoStackAtom, [...stack.slice(1), snapshot]);
    } else {
      set(undoStackAtom, [...stack, snapshot]);
    }
    set(redoStackAtom, []); // 拖拽也是新操作，应清空 redo
  }
);
```

**验证方法**：
